## 1. Third-party material is not covered by this license

The APK embeds material from other projects. In particular, the TriAevum
recompilation engine, Forge runtime and the Android changes made to them are
derived from https://github.com/coccofresco/TriAevum and are licensed under
the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later (GPL-3.0-or-later).

Other embedded components — libultraship, SDL2, SDL_GameControllerDB, NVIDIA
NRI, zstd, Rust Forge crates, the Fira Sans font, Godot-derived shaders and
others — keep their own respective licenses. The complete list and license
texts ship inside every APK under `assets/notices/` and are also summarised in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md in this repository.

Nothing in this file limits, overrides, removes or relicenses any right
granted by the GPL or by those component licenses. For that material the GPL
and the component licenses govern.

## 2. Corresponding source for the GPL material

An archive of the exact source used to build each binary release, together
with `release-manifest.json`, is attached to that release on the releases page.
See SOURCE_OFFER.md. The upstream base source is also available from
https://github.com/coccofresco/TriAevum.

